  "description": "Formation of new openings in the structural party walls between Nos. 21 and 22 at basement and ground floor levels to create a continuous retail unit. New dumwaiter to 22. Reinstatement of historic nibs and downstands. No. 21, Replacement of stair balustrades. Plastering and decoration of exposed brickwork in 22 basement. Refurbishment of existing timber floor boards. No. 21 and 22: Installation of new more efficient mechanical and electrical services. Removal of non-original partitions and finishes. Repair and redecoration of existing suspended ceilings at ground floor level. Refurbishment of existing timber sash and casement windows with addition of internal security bars and internal shopfront security barriers. Works to vaults to allow dry storage. Installation of security and fire safety systems to allow safe operation across all three properties. [Linked to 26/04622/FULL] [SITE INCLUDES 20 AND 22 NEW QUEBEC STREET]",
